      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i don't want to go to the er if i don't have to, hospital visits are so expensive and stressful. i've been taking some ibuprofen pretty heavily for the pain and it seems to help a little. could it just be inflammation from the incision? it's pretty common for things to be a bit sore a week later right?",
