    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but i'm just really anxious about it. my neighbor had a similar thing after her surgery and she said it was just gas and swelling and she just stayed home with a heating pad and it cleared up in a few days. if i just stay on top of the ibuprofen and maybe try some warm compresses, do you think i can just wait another night or two to see if the stiffness goes down? i'm really hoping it's just inflammation.",
